   - Compare the inhibitory activity of the extract to a control (e.g., control with PKA and substrate but no extract) and a known PKA inhibitor (e.g., stauroptine or GF-1000000).  
   - Measure the inhibitory activity by monitoring the phosphorylation of PKA substrate (e.g., cAMP-binding protein 1, CBP).  
