\[ \Delta S = (2 \times 66.5) + (2 \times 248.2) - (2 \times 91.2) - (3 \times 205.1) \]
\[ \Delta S = 133 + 494.4 - 192 - 610.3 \]
\[ \Delta S = 627.4 - 602.3 = 25.1 \, \text{J/K mol} \]

