\]  
where:  
- ΔT<sub>b</sub> is the boiling point elevation  
- m is the mass of the solute  
- V is the volume of the solvent  
- ΔH<sub>c</sub> is the heat constant of the liquid  
- ΔH<sub>s</sub> is the specific function of the liquid  
- n is the number of moles of the solute  
- M is the molecular weight of the solute  

