   - The second stage (serial) has reliability \( R_2(t) = 1 - \lambda t \).  
   - The overall reliability is:  
   \[
   R_S(t) = R_1(t) R_2(t) = [ 1 - (1 - \lambda t)^2 ) \cdot ( 1 - \lambda t ] = 1 - \lambda t -",fluency,"# Task Description
