E_cell ≈ 0.34 V - 0.0296 V = 0.3104 V

The power output (P) of the Galvanic cell can be calculated using the formula:

P = E_cell * I

However, we do not have information about the current (I) flowing through the cell. Therefore, we cannot calculate the exact power output of the Galvanic cell. But we have determined the cell potential under non-standard conditions, which is 0.3104 V.
