How can one prepare a selectively deuterium-labeled alkane starting from an alkene?<end_of_turn>
<start_of_turn>model
","To prepare a selectively deuterium-labeled alkane from an alkene, the following steps are commonly used:  
1. **Isaturation with D₂ gas**: The alkene is treated with deuterium gas (D₂) in the presence of a catalyst (e.g., Pd or Pd/Pd/H₂).  
